      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Builds the body for the Postiz public API (POST /public/v1/posts), sent by \"Crear post en Postiz\".\n// Replaces the four per-network n8n-nodes-postiz create-post nodes: their image list and settings are\n// fixedCollections that cannot be bound to a dynamic array, so N media items or videos were impossible.\n// INFERRED (verify against the live Postiz instance): the body shape {type,date,shortLink,tags,posts:[{\n// integration:{id},value:[{content,id,image:[{id,path}]}],settings}]} is derived from the Postiz node\n// parameters (integrationId, value.contentItem[].image.imageItem[{id,path}], settings.setting[{key,stringValue}])\n// and the public API CreatePostDto; each settings.setting {key,stringValue} entry becomes settings[key]=value.\n// Videos go in the same image[] list (Postiz detects the media type from the path).\nconst job=$('Validar trabajo').first().json.job;\nconst req=$('Preparar reprogramacion').first().json;\nconst media=(Array.isArray(req.media)?req.media:[]).filter(item=>item&&item.url).slice(0,10);\nif(!media.length)throw new Error('La publicacion requiere imagen o editorial_config.fallbackImageUrl');\nif(!req.integrationId)throw new Error('La cuenta Postiz no tiene external_account_id');\nif(req.network==='gmb'&&!req.externalUrl)throw new Error('La publicacion en GMB requiere una URL (externalUrl del job o editorial_config.site_url)');\n// Exactly the literal settings.setting arrays of the removed per-network (facebook/instagram/gmb/generic) Postiz nodes.\nconst settingsByNetwork={facebook:{__type:'facebook'},instagram:{post_type:'post'},gmb:{topicType:'STANDARD',callToActionType:'LEARN_MORE',callToActionUrl:req.externalUrl},other:{}};\nconst settings=settingsByNetwork[req.network]??settingsByNetwork.other;\nconst body={type:'schedule',date:req.desiredScheduledAt,shortLink:false,tags:[],posts:[{integration:{id:String(req.integrationId)},value:[{content:req.copy,id:job.target_id,image:media.map((item,index)=>({id:'img'+(index+1),path:item.url}))}],settings}]};\nreturn [{json:{body,network:req.network,mediaCount:media.length}}];"
